  "semantics": [
    "All original panel members, signatures, scope, snapshots, cohort evidence, namespaces and complete nonempty retention set are authenticated before computing adoption eligibility.",
    "Checked.qualified is the conjunction of the authenticated primary and every authenticated retention qualification result.",
    "The original Evaluation receipt still describes its original primary Product verdict. Its payload, signature, evidence ID, validity window and read-only interpretation are unchanged.",
    "Model admission rejects a false aggregate. Selector invokes that same pure Model-input acceptance check before checking its original comparison pin; it performs no Model effect.",
    "Read-only authenticate_current remains available for authentic Ineligible material and never implies retention success or rollback.",
    "No original metric roles, superiority/noninferiority margins, OPE arithmetic, confidence parameters, 64-episode cap, grants or owner custody are changed."
